RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows August to September and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, November to December ran 44% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 234% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 13665 had its driest year in 1954 at 58%.</p>"}
